  "text": "Every wedding venue wants more bookings. But couples don't always choose the best venue. They often choose the venue that responds first. And in today's market, the first response usually wins the tour. That's why we built VenueBot Convert. Most venues believe they're responding quickly. The reality is very different. Convert. Enquiries arrive during evenings, weekends, holidays, while your team is conducting tours, serving events or simply away from the office. Every hour that passes increases the chance that the couple speaks to somebody else. Convert removes that delay completely. Most venues follow up once, maybe twice. Then the enquiry goes quiet. But couples don't make a \u00a310,000 to \u00a320,000 venue decision overnight. That's why Convert continues nurturing every enquiry for more than 50 days, across email, SMS and WhatsApp. Not with repetitive reminders, but with timely, relevant conversations designed to keep momentum moving towards a tour.",
